herefore incomplete/non-evidence, not a pass or failure. Do not rerun it on the unoptimized tree. The next authoritative race-cmd gate is required on the fingerprint-optimized integrated candidate.\nFOCUSED TEST COMPLETION DIRECTIVE (cycle 3): Inspect the cycle-3 delta and TASK-260720-1nlmvv_implementation-notes-cycle-3.md; do not edit product code. Verify the sole unchecked criterion: cache publication is reversible on every post-publication failure, with install and upgrade end-to-end coverage. Run the exact focused tests named by the producer: TestRevertRestoresExactlyWhatAPublicationDisplaced, TestRevertFailsClosed, TestAFailedCommitRestoresTheBuildCacheItReplaced, TestARolledBackTargetCommitRestoresTheBuildCacheItReplaced, TestAnInFlightTransactionKeepsThePublishedCacheEntry, and TestInstallAndUpgradeRestoreTheCacheWhenTheCommitFails. Inspect production paths and fault injection for prepare, journal, and commit failures; also verify the four cycle-2 blockers are closed: reversible cache publication, bounded/redacted build-boundary commit errors, driver plus validated source digest in toolchain-refusal rows for human and JSON output, and fail-closed build-state-changed reporting under concurrent removal/corruption/replacement/protection loss. Do not rerun repository-wide or cmd race gates; authoritative cycle-3 gate attribution is already recorded and the cmd race gate is intentionally deferred to the integrated fingerprint candidate. If evidence proves the unchecked criterion, mark only that checklist item, attach a task-scoped tester outcome, and hand off to review. Otherwise attach exact failure evidence and route to development.\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: codex via explicit_override\nspawn launch composition: degraded_contract_unavailable; contract=agents-infra.child-launch-composition; provider=codex; schema=1; diagnostic=composition_contract_unavailable; bare child launch retained\nspawn queued: [tester] tester (codex) (run=RUN-260729-6b3539